**Bus factor.**
- Counting Graham as one person, the bus factor is 1: Graham alone holds 84.8% of the lines. Reaching 80% also takes 1 author.
- Unmerged, the bus factor is also 1 (<email redacted>, 52.1%). Reaching 80% takes 2 authors.
